@startuml
title Plane State Transition Diagram

state "Order" as Order
state Arrival
state Preparation
state Operations
state Maintenance
state "OutOf Service" as OutOfService
state "Removed From Service" as RemovedFromService

[*] --> Order : Initial state

Order --> Arrival : Delivered

Arrival --> Preparation : Arrived

Preparation --> Operations : Ready for Ops
Preparation --> Maintenance : Needs Maint or No Flights

Operations --> Maintenance : No More Flights or Maint Needed
Operations --> OutOfService : Taken out of service

Maintenance --> Preparation : Checked and Serviced

OutOfService --> RemovedFromService : Final removal

RemovedFromService --> [*] : End of lifecycle
@enduml
